      "id": "D010",
      "speaker": "典狱长",
      "text": "这一段稳住了。",
      "stage": "STORY_MAINTENANCE_ENTER",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D011",
      "speaker": "典狱长",
      "text": "回去把尚未转移的记录带出来。",
      "stage": "STORY_MAINTENANCE_ENTER",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D012",
      "speaker": "典狱长",
      "text": "我在疏散口接应。",
      "stage": "STORY_MAINTENANCE_ENTER",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D013",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "这个绳结，是我系的。",
      "stage": "STORY_ARCHIVE_RETURN",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D014",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "伊莱恩维尔……名字在她身上。",
      "stage": "STORY_ARCHIVE_RETURN",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D015",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "受伤的是她。",
      "stage": "STORY_ARCHIVE_RETURN",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D016",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "那些记忆属于她。我不是伊莱恩。",
      "stage": "STORY_ARCHIVE_RETURN",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D017",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "封印里的东西，是我。",
      "stage": "STORY_IDENTITY_CONFIRM",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D018",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "……我是怪物。",
      "stage": "STORY_IDENTITY_CONFIRM",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D019",
      "speaker": "典狱长",
      "text": "那边还有没转走的遗赠。",
      "stage": "STORY_RESCUE",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D020",
      "speaker": "典狱长",
      "text": "能听见的话，把它们带出来！",
      "stage": "STORY_RESCUE",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D021",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "我能压住它。慢一点。",
      "stage": "STORY_RESCUE",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D022",
      "speaker": "典狱长",
      "text": "收到了。这里还有人活着，继续往出口走。",
      "stage": "STORY_COMPLETE",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D023",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "我记起了自己。",
      "stage": "STORY_COMPLETE",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    },
    {
      "id": "D024",
      "speaker": "玩家内心",
      "text": "留下这些人的记忆，是我自己的决定。",
      "stage": "STORY_COMPLETE",
      "required": true,
      "voice_optional": true,
      "max_display_lines": 2,
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_event_playback; restore state without replay on checkpoint load"
    }
